SUMMARY:Scout Day at the Museum
DESCRIPTION:Scouts ages 5-10 are invited to explore the Museum galleries with a scavenger hunt\, tell a story with stop-motion animation\, learn about artists with cartoonist Abby Rocha\, and more!  Advance registration recommended. 
URL:https://schulzmuseum.org/event/scout-day-at-the-museum/
CATEGORIES:Calendar of Events
END:VEVENT
