DESCRIPTION:Meet\, watch\, and talk to cartoonist and illustrator Abby Rocha. Rocha has self-published short-form comics\, including Heartbreak Tacos\, Tides\, and Voices\, among others.
URL:https://schulzmuseum.org/event/second-saturday-cartoonist-abby-rocha/
CATEGORIES:Calendar of Events
END:VEVENT
