SUMMARY:Girl Scout Art and Design Sleepover
DESCRIPTION:Brownies and Juniors are invited to earn their Art and Design badges while sleeping overnight at the Schulz Museum! Pizza dinner and breakfast bites included. Advance registration required.
URL:https://schulzmuseum.org/event/girl-scout-art-and-design-sleepover-2/
