DESCRIPTION:Fall into fun with a full day of hands-on art and science! Embark on scavenger hunt challenges\, decorate a tote bag with apple stamps\, make pumpkin volcanoes and catapults\, and more! Instructor: Angelica Blancas-Mims
URL:https://schulzmuseum.org/event/autumn-art-and-adventure-grades-1-3/
