SUMMARY:Camp Cool (Grades 1-3)
DESCRIPTION:Get creative at the coolest camp around! Decorate a graham cracker candy house with ice-cream-cone evergreen trees\, craft a cute clay polar bear\, and have fun with exploding hot chocolate. Plus\, watch a short Peanuts movie in the Museum Theater! Instructor: Mike Marquez
URL:https://schulzmuseum.org/event/camp-cool-grades-1-3/
CATEGORIES:Classes & Camps
END:VEVENT
