UID:10004575-1795510800-1795537800@schulzmuseum.org
SUMMARY:Camp Cool Mini (Grades TK-K)
DESCRIPTION:Cozy up at the coolest camp around! Have fun with exploding hot chocolate\, decorate a graham cracker candy house\, make your own wintery playdough\, and watch a short Peanuts movie in the Museum Theater! Then\, wind down in the afternoon with free-choice sensory play. Children must be at least 4 years old to enroll. Instructor: Rachael Juarez
URL:https://schulzmuseum.org/event/camp-cool-mini-grades-tk-k/
CATEGORIES:Classes & Camps
END:VEVENT
