UID:10004576-1795597200-1795609800@schulzmuseum.org
SUMMARY:How to ‘Toon Wild Winter (Grades 1-3)
DESCRIPTION:Join cartoonist and master maze-maker Joe Wos and learn to draw penguins\, polar bears\, and reindeer in a winter wonderland from your imagination! Wos is the Emmy Award-winning host of Cartoon Academy on PBS and the creator of the internationally syndicated feature MazeToons. Instructor: Joe Wos
URL:https://schulzmuseum.org/event/how-to-toon-wild-winter-grades-1-3/
CATEGORIES:Classes & Camps
END:VEVENT
