DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the season with autumn-themed art and activities! Go on a hunt through the Museum searching for Snoopy\, make a light-up lantern\, collage a colorful leaf garland to decorate your home\, and more. Children must be at least 4 years old to enroll. Instructor: Angelica Blancas-Mims
