SUMMARY:Winter Wonderland Mini (Grades TK-K)
DESCRIPTION:Make a day of hands-on fun and winter wonderland magic! Mix and mush sparkling snow dough\, build igloos with marshmallows\, and craft a melting snowman. Spend the last hour with wind-down\, free-choice sensory play. Children must be at least 4 years old to enroll. Instructor: Angelica Blancas-Mims
