SUMMARY:Reindeer Games (Grades 1-3)
DESCRIPTION:Like Dasher and Donner\, spend the day playing reindeer games and exploring the Schulz Museum! Go on a candy-cane scavenger hunt\, race through an obstacle course\, make reindeer chow\, and craft an ornament to take home. Instructor: Rachael Juarez
