SUMMARY:Arctic Adventures (Grades TK-K)
DESCRIPTION:Journey on a make-believe adventure to the Arctic Tundra! Make a frozen sensory squish bag\, craft a walrus stick puppet\, make a polar bear treat\, and play Arctic-themed movement games. Then wind down with free-choice sensory play! Children must be at least 4 years old to enroll. Instructor: Rachel Aragaki
URL:https://schulzmuseum.org/event/arctic-adventures-grades-tk-k/
CATEGORIES:Classes & Camps
